values ('d6e7f8a9-0b1c-4d94-9e35-4f5a6b7c8d44', 'econometrics', 'Econometrics', 'Econometrics is the empirical engine of economics: it teaches students how to turn economic questions, data, assumptions, and statistical models into credible evidence. A high-quality version must separate prediction from causal identification, emphasize diagnostics and robustness, and require reproducible research habits.');

